<view class="page-shell sub-page default-voice-page" style="{{statusBarStyle}}">
  <view class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack" aria-label="返回"><image class="nav-back-icon" src="/assets/ui/v4/back-strong.svg" /></view>
  <text class="page-title">默认声音</text>
  <view class="default-voice-stage">
    <view class="default-voice-wave" aria-hidden="true"><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view></view>
  </view>
  <text class="default-voice-title">默认声音，直接使用。</text>
  <text class="page-lede">所有机器人共用默认声音，连接后直接对话，无需选择音色。</text>
  <view class="list">
    <view class="list-row"><mp-icon name="wave"></mp-icon><view class="row-copy"><text class="row-title">声音在机器人上播放</text><text class="row-meta">手机端不录音，也不发起对话</text></view></view>
    <view class="list-row"><mp-icon name="note"></mp-icon><view class="row-copy"><text class="row-title">表达方式可以独立设置</text><text class="row-meta">不会切换声音、权限或记忆归属</text></view></view>
  </view>
  <text class="privacy-note">声音与回应由 AI 生成。</text>
</view>
